  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 교과서에도 아주 잘 나와 있는 실험입니다!!<br><br>물과 식용유는 비열의 크기가 대량 2배 정도 차이가 나서, 시간에 따른 온도 변화 그래프가 아주 잘보입니다!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90f4096c2d1febd48965874b76d1023cb80f337b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/90f4096c2d1febd48965874b76d1023cb80f337b\" data-origin-width=\"1920\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">다만 화상은 항상 조심해야합니다! 장갑 필수!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76547113de7bcdbc7e67420e5cee2035570725dc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/76547113de7bcdbc7e67420e5cee2035570725dc\" data-origin-width=\"915\" data-origin-height=\"1298\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f55bdadfe7be28096f72adb8d09a8cc2b2627125\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f55bdadfe7be28096f72adb8d09a8cc2b2627125\" data-origin-width=\"902\" data-origin-height=\"1286\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f2e85395b78ce4af7622c38a4a1d39876b8471e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f2e85395b78ce4af7622c38a4a1d39876b8471e\" data-origin-width=\"922\" data-origin-height=\"1300\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이거는 다른 실험들에 비해서 굉장히<br>많이 해본 실험인데, 결과가 항상 잘나와서<br>해보기 좋습니다.<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blo